WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.168 --> 00:00:01.929
(piano music)

00:00:01.929 --> 00:00:04.666
- [Phillip] My name is
Phillip William Mick,

00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:08.030
and I'm from Auburn, Indiana.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:08.913
(bicycle bell rings)

00:00:08.913 --> 00:00:11.213
I was getting bullied
ever since second grade,

00:00:11.213 --> 00:00:15.047
third grade, fourth
grade, and fifth grade.

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:19.617
They were teasing on me,
picking on me, and all that.

00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:21.654
It was getting really bad and

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.747
I thought this might need to be fixed.

00:00:24.747 --> 00:00:25.580
(motorcycle engine noise)

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.080
(piano music)

00:00:41.273 --> 00:00:44.356
I was getting bullied for many years.

00:00:45.994 --> 00:00:48.250
People started cursing at me ‘cause,

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.247
they're wearing all rich stuff and

00:00:50.247 --> 00:00:52.032
I'm just wearing cheap stuff ‘cause,

00:00:52.032 --> 00:00:56.276
my parents can't afford the rich stuff.

00:00:56.276 --> 00:01:00.276
They were calling me
fatso cause of my weight.

00:01:03.057 --> 00:01:05.567
My mom had had enough of it.

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:10.158
She stepped in, talked with Brett, and

00:01:10.158 --> 00:01:13.292
he helps me by getting
all these bikers together

00:01:13.292 --> 00:01:15.684
to help me stop the bullying.

00:01:15.684 --> 00:01:17.491
(upbeat music)

00:01:17.491 --> 00:01:18.988
- I'm Brett Warfield director of

00:01:18.988 --> 00:01:20.703
United Motorcycle Enthusiasts.

00:01:20.703 --> 00:01:22.118
We ride together and help support

00:01:22.118 --> 00:01:25.321
our local communities do charity work.

00:01:25.321 --> 00:01:27.043
We ride to do good.

00:01:27.043 --> 00:01:28.666
It's a brotherhood.

00:01:28.666 --> 00:01:29.650
- That's what it's about.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.230
- Get along instead of being hateful.

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:33.122
Get along with people.

00:01:33.122 --> 00:01:34.142
- You gotta love everybody.

00:01:34.142 --> 00:01:35.718
- Exactly.

00:01:35.718 --> 00:01:38.795
- It started on the first day of school.

00:01:38.795 --> 00:01:41.926
We met at a restaurant.

00:01:41.926 --> 00:01:44.990
50 Bikers were there.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:49.590
The bikers took me to
school to support, and

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:52.395
tell all those people
that bullying isn't cool

00:01:52.395 --> 00:01:54.089
and you should stop it.

00:01:54.089 --> 00:01:56.973
And instead of saying it, they showed it.

00:01:56.973 --> 00:01:57.956
- Good for you, man.

00:01:57.956 --> 00:01:58.860
Now you want to know something,

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.634
we all love you.

00:02:00.634 --> 00:02:02.396
We want you to know that.

00:02:02.396 --> 00:02:06.152
- They only thought that a
few people would understand,

00:02:06.152 --> 00:02:09.113
but actually there's tons of people.

00:02:09.113 --> 00:02:12.667
Now, there's a lot of kids
who wants to be my friends.

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:16.667
It just relieves all of my
feelings and all of that.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:23.572
It was my first time on a motorcycle.

00:02:25.447 --> 00:02:27.588
It felt like I was flying.

00:02:27.588 --> 00:02:31.722
(music gets louder)

00:02:31.722 --> 00:02:34.361
Me and Brett are trying
to stop bullying because

00:02:34.361 --> 00:02:37.444
many kids think that
the bully's the big guy,

00:02:37.444 --> 00:02:41.444
but really the big guy is actually you.

00:02:44.403 --> 00:02:46.137
- Pay attention to your children.

00:02:46.137 --> 00:02:47.797
Teach your kids empathy.

00:02:47.797 --> 00:02:48.960
Open you're heart up.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.857
See how you would feel.

00:02:50.857 --> 00:02:52.439
Love is the answer.

00:02:52.439 --> 00:02:55.022
(gentle music)

